28 × 641 centrée\n2 colonnes : texte 376 | illustration 400", "textAlign": "center", "updated": 1793826462509, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1221520249, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nl-1e-t", "type": "text", "x": 9520, "y": 5502, "width": 462, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "bjN", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1E · Arbre de composants → HTML sémantique", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1929649203, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1E · Arbre de composants → HTML sémantique", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793826462509, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1783864463, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nl-1e-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 9520, "y": 5552, "width": 920, "height": 400, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "bjO", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 936609802, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793826462509, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1977698850}, {"id": "nl-1e-b", "type": "text", "x": 9544, "y": 5572, "width": 880, "height": 340, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 3, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "bjP", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "main\n├─ article.card                       (formulaire)\n│  ├─ picture                         illustration mobile / tablette / desktop (alt=\"\")\n│  └─ div.card__content\n│     ├─ h1        Stay updated!\n│     ├─ p         Join 60,000+ product managers…\n│     ├─ ul        3 × li (icône décorative + texte)\n│     └─ form      novalidate\n│        ├─ div    label[for=email] + p#email-error (aria-live)\n│        ├─ input#email  type=email, aria-describedby=email-error\n│        └─ button type=submit   Subscribe to monthly newsletter\n├─ section.success                    (caché au départ)\n│  ├─ img         icon-success.svg (alt=\"\")\n│  ├─ h1          Thanks for subscribing!   (tabindex=-1, reçoit le focus)\n│  ├─ p           … <strong>email saisi</strong> …\n│  └─ button type=button   Dismiss message\nfooter.attribution                     (starter FM, Q7)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2005270525, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "main\n├─ article.card                       (formulaire)\n│  ├─ picture                         illustration mobile / tablette / desktop (alt=\"\")\n│  └─ div.card__content\n│     ├─ h1        Stay updated!\n│     ├─ p         Join 60,000+ product managers…\n│     ├─ ul        3 × li (icône décorative + texte)\n│     └─ form      novalidate\n│        ├─ div    label[for=email] + p#email-error (aria-live)\n│        ├─ input#email  type=email, aria-describedby=email-error\n│        └─ button type=submit   Subscribe to monthly newsletter\n├─ section.success                    (caché au départ)\n│  ├─ img         icon-success.svg (alt=\"\")\n│  ├─ h1          Thanks for subscribing!   (tabindex=-1, reçoit le focus)\n│  ├─ p           … <strong>email saisi</strong> …\n│  └─ button type=button   Dismiss message\nfooter.attribution                     (starter FM, Q7)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793826462509, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 524948561, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "nl-g2", "type": "text", "x": 9000, "y": 6102, "width": 714, "height": 35, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": nul